<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Your TCG Brand | Pokémon Cards & Live Breaks</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Official landing page for Pokémon and TCG live sales, Whatnot streams, singles, slabs, packs, and collectibles." />

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card: #111c35;
      --accent: #ffcb05;
      --accent2: #3b82f6;
      --text: #ffffff;
      --muted: #b8c4d8;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(59,130,246,.25), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0f172a, #07101f);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 20px 30px;
    }

    .logo {
      width: 110px;
      height: 110px;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--accent), #ff4d4d);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 44px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #111;
      border: 5px solid white;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(32px, 7vw, 58px);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    .tagline {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .badge-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .badge {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(17, 28, 53, .9);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
    }

    .card h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: block;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #07101f;
      background: var(--accent);
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(255,203,5,.25);
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(255,203,5,.35);
    }

    .btn.secondary {
      background: white;
      color: #07101f;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(255,255,255,.15);
    }

    .btn.blue {
      background: var(--accent2);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(59,130,246,.3);
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .mini {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .mini strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    .mini span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      padding: 24px 0 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 34px;
      }

      .grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="logo">TCG</div>

      <h1>Your Brand Name</h1>

      <p class="tagline">
        Pokémon cards, live Whatnot shows, singles, slabs, packs, and collector-ready TCG drops.
      </p>

      <div class="badge-row">
        <div class="badge">Live Breaks</div>
        <div class="badge">Singles</div>
        <div class="badge">Slabs</div>
        <div class="badge">Sealed Product</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Catch Us Live</h2>
      <p>
        We go live on Whatnot with Pokémon cards, TCG deals, giveaways, auctions,
        and collector-focused drops. Follow the shop to get notified before the next stream.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a class="btn" href="https://www.whatnot.com/user/bradhar56040" target="_blank">Shop on Whatnot</a>
        <a class="btn secondary" href="https://www.instagram.com/trainersvaultllc" target="_blank">Follow on Instagram</a>
        <a class="btn blue" href="mailto:Trainersvaultllc@yahoo.com">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>What We Sell</h2>
      <p>
        From affordable binder cards to graded slabs and sealed product, we focus on giving collectors
        a fun, trustworthy place to buy, trade, and build their collection.
      </p>

      <div class="grid">
        <div class="mini">
          <strong>Singles</strong>
          <span>Modern, vintage & hits</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mini">
          <strong>Slabs</strong>
          <span>Graded collector cards</span>
        </div>

        <div class="mini">
          <strong>Live Sales</strong>
          <span>Auctions & stream deals</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>Why Collectors Shop With Us</h2>
      <p>
        We keep it simple: fair deals, honest condition notes, secure packaging, and a live shopping
        experience that makes collecting fun.
      </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      © 2026 Your Brand Name. Pokémon is a trademark of Nintendo, Game Freak, and The Pokémon Company.
      This site is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
    </footer>

  </main>
</body>
</html>
